&ldquo;Now, ain&rsquo;t that strange! I never expected to live to see that.
What is your trade? I mean how do you get your living? What is your line of
business?&rdquo;

&ldquo;And the rest girls. It&rsquo;s just as I expected. But that&rsquo;s all
right, and it&rsquo;s better so, anyway. What are the boys doing&mdash;learning
a trade?&rdquo;

&ldquo;Um&mdash;that&rsquo;s bad&mdash;yes, and unfair, too. Do you suppose
that if I should go there and have a talk with your people&mdash;Look
here&mdash;do you think you could run a brewery?&rdquo;
